hanks for taking the time to answer my questions! it was very appreciated!<br /> <br /> EDIT: and thanks for taking time to talk about deviant both on here and on the video","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-23T05:52:03-08:00","id":1291103,"title":"","content":"Dear <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1094-eric-zawadzki\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1094\" data-vbnamecard=\"1094\">Eric Zawadzki</a>. Could you elobarate more on the Mutant Clade?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-23T07:24:42-08:00","id":1291123,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1094-eric-zawadzki\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1094\" data-vbnamecard=\"1094\">Eric Zawadzki</a>. Thanks for the Pathcast interview. I only really had a cursory interest in deviant until I listened to the interview. Bring on the Kickstarter. I'm ready for this one. Just see if you can do it after the Aberrant KS. Thanks!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=485\" data-tempid=\"temp_485_1538393298974_786\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1277-karpomatic","name":"karpomatic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1277_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"143"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-23T08:44:18-08:00","id":1291145,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1032843-what-we-know-so-far-deviant-the-renegades?p=1291103#post1291103\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Dear <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1094-eric-zawadzki\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1094\" data-vbnamecard=\"1094\">Eric Zawadzki</a>. Could you elobarate more on the Mutant Clade?</div> </div> </div> </div>Did you have a specific question in mind?<br /> <br /> Speaking of Clades in general, a Clade doesn't describe the means by which you were changed, although that method often has an influence. Many who receive organ transplants from alien creatures become Chimerics, for example, but not all. Sometimes the organ donor's nature infuses the Deviant on a spiritual level, resulting in a Coactive. Or the sensation of the pulsating organ inside is such a source of trauma that it cracks open the victim's mind, producing a Cephalist. If the victim's body rejects that organ so violently that her anatomy changes in response to it, unlocking capabilities ordinarily beyond those of human anatomy, that's a Mutant.<br /> <br /> Mutation is a biological reaction to a supernatural stimulus, a kind of immune response - whether exposure occurred in a lab last week, in utero, or to your parents before you were born. How that looks is distinctly biological, and it lends itself to further mutation (to a potentially cancerous degree) and abilities commonly associated with Mutants (and fewer associated with other Clades).<br /> <br /> A Deviant's Progenitor might be able to say &quot;I was trying to produce a hybrid, but the transplant didn't take,&quot; but most conspiracies the Remade encounters aren't going to have those pages of her proprietary medical record. Instead, they will observe the Broken for telltale Clade markers - biologically expressed supernatural abilities, Clade Variations, and Adaptations - and taxonomically classify her based on that. Often, their assessments are correct, although less established conspiracies are more likely to make mistakes (or to have never encountered a member of that Clade before).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/browse.php?x=0&amp;y=0&amp;author=Eric%20Zawadzki\" target=\"_blank\">Onyx Path Freelancer</a></b> and former Deviant line developer.<br /> <br /> Deviant projects now on STV: <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/486079/Shallow-Graves?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Shallow Graves</b></a> and <a href=\"https://site.storytellersvault.com/product/550535/Black-Vans?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Black Vans</b></a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/Dayzdark\" target=\"_blank\">Updates and excerpts of current projects available here</a>.\u200b","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":""