here would certainly be an irony to a Hunter Conspiracy finding itself in the crosshairs of a cohort of Renegades who regard that Conspiracy as something sinister.<br /> <br /> Something like the question of what Lucifuge would think of the demonic power lurking in Sister Laura is probably unanswerable, at least beyond &amp;quot;what do you think would be most interesting in *your* chronicle?&amp;quot; It's not much different than asking what Lucifuge would think of Fractals. They're neat questions with the potential to drive excellent stories, but the answers are going to vary from troupe to troupe.</div> </div> </div> </div>thanks for the in depth response! I completely agree it's an interesting concept to explore in both gamelines.<br /> <br /> also, I know this is very late, but I like how the session that group played demonstrated how revenge gets many innocents killed. it brings more nuance in how, while unintentional, Deviants can do just as much harm as conspiracies with their antics","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-06T03:31:24-07:00","id":1303038,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eric Zawadzki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1032843-what-we-know-so-far-deviant-the-renegades?p=1302988#post1302988\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue